WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:05.340
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
on Arrow the shit pretty much hit the fan.

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:12.349
All the characters started to connect the
dots on what’s really been happening all

00:00:12.349 --> 00:00:16.650
year and we got a major teaser for season
3.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:22.300
If you’re finding me for the first time
I do Arrow videos every week and to celebrate

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.550
the final I’ve been doing special bonus
videos and Q&amp;As, be sure to subscribe to get

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:27.550
everything.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:30.470
I’ll have links to all that stuff in the
description and at the end of the video.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.470
So let’s start with Top 5 moments, and then
I’ll do my review.

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:35.690
Careful for spoilers from the episode if you
haven’t seen it yet.

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:36.690
Here we go.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.230
Number 5 - The New Arrow Cave

00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:43.690
It may or may not be a teaser for them getting
a new Arrow Cave in season 3.

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.930
I wouldn’t be surprised.

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:49.830
Oliver’s other base of operations basically
has everything but the gear.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:54.280
And because Felicity and Diggle didn’t know
about it, it means Slade and Isabel don’t

00:00:54.280 --> 00:00:55.610
know about it.

00:00:55.610 --> 00:01:00.780
Remember how I keep saying Team Arrow is growing,
when you look at shots like this where they’re

00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.890
all hunched over Roy, it makes the current
Arrow Cave look claustrophobic.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:10.520
It’s almost like there’s barely room to
do Salmon Ladders.

00:01:10.520 --> 00:01:16.470
The new Arrow Cave looks a lot like Christian
Bale’s Dark Knight Batcave underneath the

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:17.470
construction site.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:20.720
Just a nice wide open area to train and shoot
arrows at tennis balls.

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:24.920
Don’t be surprised if next year Oliver moves
them to the new space, given the addition

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:34.770
of Roy, Laurel and maybe even Thea.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.270
Number 4 - Ravager Returns the Favor

00:01:37.270 --> 00:01:41.729
I like that they modeled her costume after
the comic book Ravager instead of just giving

00:01:41.729 --> 00:01:43.799
her the hockey mask everyone else is wearing.

00:01:43.799 --> 00:01:48.119
I always love watching Summer Glau fight,
so I’m hoping that Nyssa Al Ghul and Sara

00:01:48.119 --> 00:01:49.450
will take her on in the finale.

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:56.909
In case you were wondering, the first official
picture from the finale was of Nyssa.

00:01:56.909 --> 00:02:00.970
Isabel’s major arc is essentially over,
she’s accomplished her goal of taking over

00:02:00.970 --> 00:02:02.090
Queen Industries.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:07.880
All she’s doing now is pouring salt in the
wound and taking Revenge on Diggle for killing

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:08.880
her.

00:02:08.880 --> 00:02:11.690
The plus side of that being, that most of
her time in the last two episodes is going

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:14.020
to be spent dancing around with swords.

00:02:14.020 --> 00:02:15.640
Just sit back and enjoy the show.

00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:19.870
It reminds me of Serenity when she killed
all the Reavers with those blades.

00:02:19.870 --> 00:02:22.910
Number 3 - Felicity Will Be Your Interrogator

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:26.930
Can we please have more Felicity double take
moments like this next season?

00:02:26.930 --> 00:02:31.320
I love how her humor worked with the larger
Brother Blood Army storyline.

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:34.819
Even when the shit hits the fan she finds
time to slip a few jokes in.

00:02:34.819 --> 00:02:39.319
I love how she uses her skills to get the
information out of him, instead of Diggle

00:02:39.319 --> 00:02:40.320
beating him to death.

00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:43.800
It’s like that “Pen Is Mightier than the
Sword” scene from Indiana Jones.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.730
In this case it was Felicity is mightier than
the fist.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.379
I can’t wait to see the Bitch with Wifi
tumblr gifs.

00:02:50.379 --> 00:02:52.270
If you didn’t catch it later, when she was
in the van Cisco Ramon was calling her about

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:53.270
the cure.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:54.660
Number 2 - Laurel In The Arrow Cave

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:56.550
This was huge and totally unexpected.

00:02:56.550 --> 00:03:00.660
I knew she’d be helping them but I thought
it would be under the radar until the finale

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.340
or even season 3.

00:03:02.340 --> 00:03:04.800
But I loved that she was his call to action.

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:07.940
And that they remembered Tommy.

00:03:07.940 --> 00:03:12.190
Based on these new developments I would plan
on Laurel acting as the new Quentin if he

00:03:12.190 --> 00:03:14.800
were a real member of the team.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:18.830
She might even end up running for Mayor if
they don’t do the Oliver Queen Mayor story

00:03:18.830 --> 00:03:19.970
from the comic books.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:24.550
I know everyone keeps asking about her becoming
the Black Canary and Sara’s status during

00:03:24.550 --> 00:03:31.411
the finale is still unkown, but I still feel
like it’s too soon for Laurel to go all

00:03:31.411 --> 00:03:32.909
parkour and black leather.

00:03:32.909 --> 00:03:37.409
Number 1 - Team Arrow Tries to Convince Oliver
Not To Commit Suicide

00:03:37.409 --> 00:03:40.370
The best Arrow scenes are always the team
scenes.

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:43.599
Especially when they get so emotional Felicity
starts to cry.

00:03:43.599 --> 00:03:47.710
It reminded me a lot of that scene in episode
13 at the campaign rally where Felicity got

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:52.350
so upset when she thought she might lose Oliver.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:55.970
After all they’ve been through they’re
as much a family as you can be.

00:03:55.970 --> 00:04:01.599
I think this was the last type of scene like
this we’ll see until the finale.

00:04:01.599 --> 00:04:06.000
It was that moment of silence between Moira’s
Death and the Army being released.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:14.080
But now that they’re out, the next episode
is going to be all explosions.

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.949
But now it’s your turn, let me know what
your favorite moments was.

00:04:16.949 --> 00:04:21.739
Felicity with wifi, Laurel in the Arrow Cave
or the mirakuru army?

00:04:21.739 --> 00:04:25.129
Here’s a couple bonus moments that were
really important but didn’t make my top

00:04:25.129 --> 00:04:26.740
5 -

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:30.099
Oliver revealing himself to Brother Blood.

00:04:30.099 --> 00:04:32.539
He was basically trying to reason with him.

00:04:32.539 --> 00:04:34.099
Blood really is Slade’s pawn.

00:04:34.099 --> 00:04:36.849
I keep saying that he’ll get thrown under
the bus before the end.

00:04:36.849 --> 00:04:40.409
I did like that Blood had a real plan for
Starling City.

00:04:40.409 --> 00:04:44.599
It reminded me of when Merlyn talked about
his plan for Starling in Season 1, save it

00:04:44.599 --> 00:04:47.400
by destroying it.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.520
Then there was the Thea plot.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.419
She’s going to run into Merlyn next week.

00:04:50.419 --> 00:04:52.319
We even saw him in the teaser.

00:04:52.319 --> 00:04:56.869
It sounds like she’s slowly connecting the
dots between Slade and Oliver and the Island.

00:04:56.869 --> 00:05:01.050
And because we saw Merlyn in his Dark Archer
gear I think Thea will definitely learn the

00:05:01.050 --> 00:05:02.809
truth about everything.

00:05:02.809 --> 00:05:10.199
Meaning she’ll either go away with Merlyn
or join Team Arrow in season 3.

00:05:10.199 --> 00:05:13.620
Felicity’s call at the end was also really
important.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:17.059
That was Cisco calling her about the Mirakuru
Cure.

00:05:17.059 --> 00:05:20.830
Because the soldiers are scattered all over
the city, the cure is going to probably have

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:23.430
to be airborne.

00:05:23.430 --> 00:05:25.059
Or maybe a bomb.

00:05:25.059 --> 00:05:28.159
Whatever it is, it will be really cool.

00:05:28.159 --> 00:05:32.309
And Slade calling Brother Blood pretending
to be his father.

00:05:32.309 --> 00:05:35.979
I just thought that was really funny given
all the talking he did about his parents at

00:05:35.979 --> 00:05:36.979
Moira’s wake.

00:05:36.979 --> 00:05:41.619
Overall I gave the episode an A minus, just
because there was no way they were going to

00:05:41.619 --> 00:05:43.990
top the end of last week’s episode.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:47.520
I can’t say enough about the character development
this season.

00:05:47.520 --> 00:05:51.939
I’m mostly talking about Laurel, but even
the core team members have changed in really

00:05:51.939 --> 00:05:55.710
profound ways and will continue to until the
finale.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:59.240
Felicity even kind of shone a light on it
when she told Oliver you’ve been trying

00:05:59.240 --> 00:06:01.669
really hard this season not to kill people.

00:06:01.669 --> 00:06:08.590
But there were another couple lines of dialogue
that I think foreshadowed the finale.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:10.779
The biggest was Isabel Rochev mentioning the
Island.

00:06:10.779 --> 00:06:13.889
If you saw my predictions I said they’ll
probably end the season back on the Island.

00:06:13.889 --> 00:06:16.919
Then Felicity geeking out on Amanda Waller’s
gear.

00:06:16.919 --> 00:06:20.949
It was adorable, but I think she’s going
to get her hands on some of it for season

00:06:20.949 --> 00:06:21.949
3.

00:06:21.949 --> 00:06:26.050
Kind of tying in with my idea that they’ll
get a whole new upgraded Arrow Cave.

00:06:26.050 --> 00:06:29.199
So let me know what you’re hoping to see
next week.

00:06:29.199 --> 00:06:33.819
It’s basically going to be the mirakuru
army punishing the city and Oliver trying

00:06:33.819 --> 00:06:35.449
to drop the cure bomb on them.

00:06:35.449 --> 00:06:38.710
Be sure to subscribe to get my video, and
leave me suggestions for next week’s bonus

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:39.710
video.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.590
My Q&amp;A will post tomorrow like normal.

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.640
You can click here to get it.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:48.580
I’ll add the annotation as soon as I post
it and click here for my breakdown of the

00:06:48.580 --> 00:06:49.639
Justice League movie.

00:06:49.639 --> 00:06:51.330
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:51.749
High Fives!

